#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/25
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you finish, Tyrell takes the wet towel from you, cradling it in his arms as he walks out the door, speaking soothingly to it in a quiet voice."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/36
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well that was somethin'."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/44
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I thought I was about to smell like bubblegum for the rest of the month."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/49
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He shudders."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/57
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Ain't even gonna think about what else mighta happened if I never got that stuff offa me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You'd never be able to hold anything again."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd have had to replace you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/67/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah let's not go down that road."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "A table's worst nightmare!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "NO! I coulda done the job!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well... no point in talkin' about the what-ifs now."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "It's over."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Exactly. I don't wanna think about any of that."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You really helped me out of a tight spot... and I ain't the kinda guy who likes to rely on others."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-1/5
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I just don't like bein' in the spotlight. Especially not for nothin' like that."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-1/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "But sometimes a table's got to rely on somebody else... and I guess if it's you... maybe it ain't so bad."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-1/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've got your back, Abel."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-1/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm really glad to hear that."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-1/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's really not a big deal."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I see that... I really do. And I appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "And I'm glad to know it."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Wish it were as easy as just sayin' so, pal... but it ain't."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Just glad to have that bubblegum nightmare over with."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/help_abel_towel/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well, now that's all over, I got work I need to get back to."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I just..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He looks at the two of you and sighs, realizing he's outnumbered."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/13
msgctxt "Tyrell"
msgid "Stop complaining, I'll be out of your timber in just a few."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tyrell goes to work, unfolding his little towel buddy and expertly drying Abel with a few smooth, fluid motions."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/29
msgctxt "Tyrell"
msgid "Was that so hard?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/37
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He slings the now-wet towel over his shoulder."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/45
msgctxt "Tyrell"
msgid "Time to get <i>you</i> dried off now, buddy..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/56
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He walks off without another word, seemingly more concerned with the towel's welfare."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/61
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well that was embarassin'."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/69/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's the big deal about that?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/70/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah that towel thing was a little weird..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/71/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You gotta learn to be okay being vulnerable."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "What's the big deal?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Yeah it was. But you know what... I understand to an extent."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Towelin' folks off is his job. It makes sense he's particular about it."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Heheh. You say that like it's easy!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "It ain't the sorta thing a solid table like myself can just decide to do!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "But you 'n Tyrell helped me out of a tight spot, and I'm mighty grateful."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I've wasted enough time today now—I gotta get back to work."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/tyrell_help_abel/0/g-0/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Y'all take care."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/0
msgctxt "Tyrell"
msgid "<i>Get lost</i>?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Now hold on a minute, I ain't sayin' all that-"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tyrell turns on his heel and leaves, taking his towel bunny with him."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/24
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Why would you go and say somethin' like that to Tyrell!?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/32
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "He was only here to help."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/37
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I might got a problem lettin' others help me but I ain't tryin' to hurt nobody over it!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/45
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Now I'm soaked and Tyrell's upset!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How is any of this my problem?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You just seemed like you wanted him gone..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was just trying to help..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Oh it ain't."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Not like that I didn't."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Maybe so, but that wasn't no kinda help."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Now I'm soaked and Tyrell's upset."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Just get on out of here. I'll handle this myself."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dont_help_abel_towel/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He doesn't bother waiting for your answer, he just walks off away from you towards the bathroom, leaving a trail of water as he goes."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/4
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you walk up on Abel you find him in a state of distress—though the reason is immediately apparent."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey there, Abel. Whoa, you're soaked."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Aw, tarnation. Why'd you have to come by now?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/10
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "What happened to him? You should be asking what happened to ME!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/21
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Beggin' yer pardon ma'am, but we're both drippin' like a cracked bucket in a typhoon."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/29
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Oh my apologies, this must be SO hard for YOU!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is there a leak somewhere?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "How am I to know!? All I know is I woke up in the middle of the night like this, absolutely WATERLOGGED. Entirely unacceptable!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/18
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Of course she woke me up not long after."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/26
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You gotta take care of Ms. Celia first. But she ain't the only one."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/31/b/1
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Poor Keith had to relocate for a little while."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/34
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I got so many folks countin' on me... I ain't much good to 'em like this."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/42
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Someone get a hold of Tony and send him up here IMMEDIATELY to fix this!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/50/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>'Tony, c'mere!!'</i>"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/50/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Toolbox. Handy guy. Nice fella."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/50/g-0/3
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Uh... sorry. Been up to my ears in contracts for jobs around the house and... y'know..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/50/g-0/11
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "You know quite well that the needs of the governance outweigh your silly 'special projects'."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/50/g-0/19
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Right away, Madame Mayor."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/50/g-0/30
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Whew, she's terrifying."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Unbelievable."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/g-0/14
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well, Celia's got her leak fixed, but what about me?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As if on cue, a cool breeze rolls through."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/g-0/27/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina has arrived, as though summoned by Abel's distress call."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/g-0/30/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It takes you a moment, but you recognize her as your fan—the hair is a dead giveaway."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/g-0/33/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Fantina... what're you doin' here?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/g-0/33/8/b/1 abel_table/landing_spill/0/g-0/33/17/b/1
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh. My. God."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/g-0/33/11/b/1
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I heard somebody needed my help..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/landing_spill/0/g-0/33/14/b/1
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Tony sent me here. Didn't know you weren't alone."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It hurts me to be here... so if you don't mind I'm just gonna get this over with, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/8 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina blasts Abel with air so intense you wonder for a moment if a tornado is passing through your house."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/16 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/32 abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/11 abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel looks like he's caught in a wind tunnel, his lips parting and cheeks shaking, showing his teeth in a cartoonish grimace."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/27 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/43 abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/22 abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina's air makes short work of the spill, drying Abel and the floor around him."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/32 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/48 abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When she's done, Abel tips his hat to her."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/37 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/56
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Oh, thank you kindly, ma'am. I appreciate the help."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/45
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yeah. Well. Glad someone around here appreciates me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/53
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks directly into your eyes for a full minute, saying nothing else."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/58 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/96
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Uh... sure... thanks again."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/66
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Without another word, she leaves you and Abel alone, in awkward silence."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/71 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/112
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well uh... dang."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/79 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/120
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I was gonna tell you how hard it is for me to rely on others when I'm the one who's supposed to be helpin' everybody..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/84 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/125
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "But whatever's goin' on between the two of you really just took all the air outta the room."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/89 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/130
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "So I guess maybe I should thank ya... hard to focus on my own feelins' when somebody else has bigger problems."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/97/s/0 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/138/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're welcome?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/98/s/0 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/139/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Didn't take you for the kind to delight in others' misery."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/99/s/0 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/140/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guess so..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/c-0/7 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I ain't sayin' to make a habit of it or nothin'... but it sure worked today."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/c-1/13 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I ain't that at all! Come on now..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/c-1/21 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Thought you'd know me better'n that."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/c-2/7 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/c-2/7 abel_table/abel_fifth_chat/0/c-0/10
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/g-0/0 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Another long silence."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/g-0/5 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/g-0/5
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Welp! Got a lot to do... I'd thank ya for bein' here, but..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/g-0/13 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/g-0/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Not sure if it made much difference. Still, probably the decent thing to do."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/g-0/18 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/g-0/21
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "So... thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_sad/0/g-0/23 abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/g-0/29
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Now I got a lotta work to get back to, so I'll catch up with you later."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina looks right through you—she seems entirely unbothered by your presence here."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/5
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Tony sent me to help you, so I'm gonna just do that."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/16
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Appreciate it, Fantina."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/64
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Mmm. Yeah."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/72
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Happy to help or whatever."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/80
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Recommend you keep better company... but also, I totally don't care."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/88
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Later."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_meh/0/104
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She leaves without another word, leaving you and Abel in an awkward silence."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I... I heard Abel needed help, but I... I didn't think you'd be here too!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/11
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ohhh my god oh my god oh my god okay."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/22
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Okay okay. I'm calm. I'm cool. I got this."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel looks back and forth between the two of you, still dripping water."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/38
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Uh... you alright there, Fantina?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Abel needs our help. Let's focus."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's wrong with her?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm glad you're here, Fantina."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh god you're right, I'm so sorry! Here I am making this about me..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm so sorry! PLEASE FORGIVE ME!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/c-0/32
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Alright alright, let's not lose focus again."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Whoah, that ain't no way to talk about someone when they're standin' right there!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You... you are?!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her eyes grow cartoonishly big and shiny."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/c-2/20
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm so happy!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/c-2/34
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "We're gonna get Abel through this together!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel looks pained at the thought of being indebted to the both of you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well... what're you gonna do, then?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "We're gonna dry all that water!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "If you could like, like direct me...?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/35/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She seems to quiver with anticipation at the thought of you touching her."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/35/b/9
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "J-just... put your hands on my shoulders... and..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you can handle it on your own."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm starting to think this might be a bad idea."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You really believe in me that much!?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Okayokayokay. I got this! I'm gonna do it!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "ME TOO! LET'S DO THIS!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "What?! No it ain't! Fantina, don't you liste-"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You grab Fantina by the shoulders, aiming her at Abel. She lets out a blast of air so intense you wonder for a moment if a tornado is passing through your house."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When she's done, Abel tips his hat to the two of you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Thank you kindly. Much obliged, you two."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina isn't even looking at Abel."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/51
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Are you kidding me... working with you is all the thanks I need."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/59
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm gonna be walking on air for a week..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She walks away in a happy daze, only pausing to shoot a contented look back at you. There might as well be hearts in her eyes."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/75
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well... alright."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/83
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I gotta say... when you came by I thought I was gonna be embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/91
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "And I guess I was for a little while, but... look at me now!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/99
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I'm right as rain' and feelin' like an old toad with a brand new lilypad."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/107/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Toads don't sit on lilypads. That's frogs."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/108/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just what does an old toad with a brand new lilypad feel like?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/109/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And you make me feel like a sleepy cat that found a sunbeam."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "It ain't about the amphibian!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "It's just a metaphor. I was tryin' to say you make me feel brand new."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/c-6/29
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "But then again, brand new ain't really what I'm feelin' at this moment."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Just like it sounds! Brand new!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Y'see, I'm the old toad. The lilypad is my attitude."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/c-7/26
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "It's a metaphor, darlin'."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/c-7/34
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "It ain't really about the toad 'n the lilypad. Are ya followin' me?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/c-7/42
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "But hey, don't worry. You stick around me long enough'n you'll get the hang of how I talk sooner or later."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "...dang. That good, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-1/c-8/21
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well, you're really speakin' my language now."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I ain't been able to do much work since all this started... so I'd better get back to it."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_abel_stoked/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "See ya around, alright? You take care now."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_run_away/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your words hit home—Fantina looks at you with tears in her eyes, her lip quivering."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_run_away/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Fantina, it ain't like that-"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_run_away/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "WAHHHH!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_run_away/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She runs out of the room at a full sprint, her cries echoing through the halls."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_run_away/32
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Oh, now why would you say somethin' like that?! You know Fantina's real sensitive, especially when it comes to you an' your opinion of 'er!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_run_away/43
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Dang dang dang. Now how the hell 'm I gonna dry off?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_run_away/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He glares at you, shaking his head."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_run_away/59
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Don't even answer that. I'll just figure it out myself."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_run_away/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He walks off down the hall, leaving a trail of water in his wake."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina blasts Abel with air so intense, you wonder for a moment if a tornado is passing through your house."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/32
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well, thank you kindly, ma'am. I appreciate the help."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/40
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "No problem! What are fans for, after all..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina exits, leaving the two of you alone."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/56
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Can't believe the solution was as easy as all that."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/64
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I dealt with a few spills in my time... ain't never just air-dried tho..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a lot easier to just wipe it up."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I should just start carrying her around the house."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/74/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why were you so upset if you're used to it?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Maybe so... but I can't say I mind gettin' it done that fast."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Besides, it'd give Tyrell a break from havin' to be the one who handles all of these."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well I don't know if you need to do all that..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "But she did help me out of a tight spot."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well heck... it's gotta be the worst part of bein' a table."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/abel_fantina_skip/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Spills are part of the job, but my job's supposed to be helpin'!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/abel_fantina_skip/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Havin' to be the one who's relyin' on others... it pains me to the depths of my wooden soul."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/abel_fantina_skip/16
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I'm just glad I didn't have to put <i>you</i> out in the process."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/abel_fantina_skip/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's no biggie... just checking on you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/abel_fantina_skip/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Relying on others is important!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "The sooner I can get this stuff over with the better."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "And seein' as it's done... I gotta get back to work."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/fantina_help_alone/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You take care now!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Abel. What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem quieter than usual..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Something on your mind?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Oh... hey there."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Do I? I guess I got a lot on my mind."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Guess you could say so."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "It's been great hangin' out with ya lately... but I just can't seem to quiet the storm inside 'a me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "If'n ya don't mind... I'd rather talk about anything or anyone else."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't have much to say myself, honestly..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What would you rather talk about?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like what?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Maybe we can talk about some of our friends?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "My friends always make me happy."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-1/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we should talk about Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-1/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, I'll talk to some friends."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-1/16/c-6/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Dasha?! W-why..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-1/16/c-6/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was an interesting reaction you just had."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-1/16/c-6/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on, it's obvious you like her."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-1/16/c-6/18/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "On second thought, maybe we shouldn't talk at all."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fourth_chat/0/g-1/16/c-6/18/g-0/12
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Oh, this is all too much for me. I'm a simple table."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fifth_chat/0/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel is clearly a thousand miles away—he looks absolutely lost in thought."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fifth_chat/0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When he finally notices you his demeanor doesn't change in the least."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fifth_chat/0/26
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Oh, hey. Sorry, lots to do."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fifth_chat/0/34
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "All's well here."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fifth_chat/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you say so..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fifth_chat/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to talk about us, Abel."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_fifth_chat/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "...huh?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/0 abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Hey there."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You get a chance to talk with Kopi?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, she actually gave me this cup of coffee for you. She said it was your favorite."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Mmm! She sure does know her way around a cup of coffee."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Thank you, I needed this today."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is something bothering you?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's this about..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Me? No, no."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-1/3
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Oh, it's nothing to trouble yourself over."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-1/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So... do you know a lot of the others around the house?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-1/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Know any good stories?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-1/c-3/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I know most of the house, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-1/c-3/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "We've got our fair share of characters, but as a whole, I'd say we're a good bunch."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Plenty of stories to tell."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about you?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Me? Oh, sure, I've got stories, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "They're not exactly exciting, though."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You know what!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You want exciting, you should talk to the Captain."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Why, I swear he's seen it all."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Why don't you go ask Captain Jacques about his time on the high seas?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_coffee_thanks/0/g-3/51
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "...heh."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You look like you got a story you're itchin' to share."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/16
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I take it you talked to the Captain, then, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I did! And he told me a great story, all about a stoic traveler."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He said that you were a boring table. The end."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Ah heck, I don't like where this is going."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They said the traveler was liked by everyone he met..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/c-0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Come on now..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...and that, despite how rough things may have been in the past, he always did his best to support others."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Oh, this is the last time I confide in that salty son of a gun."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seems like you're happy to help anyone you meet, but you won't share even a little bit about yourself?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Abel?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Yeah, look, I just..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "...time spent on me's time I'm not spendin' on others, right?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Ha! Straightforward and honest."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You remind me of my old rectangular friend."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your rectangular friend?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right, Dasha. Nice lady."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Y'know... Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "The desk! Real, nice gal."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Anyway, you remind me of her. She's a sly one, too. Hehehe."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-1/12
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Always tryin' t'get me to focus on myself."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-1/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you're more interesting than you're giving yourself credit for."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-1/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Keep on tablin' you big sexy table."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well, that's real nice of you to say... Oh..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You mind giving me some time to myself?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-1/c-5/23
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I need to get my head on straight."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-1/c-5/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, sure. As long as you're gonna be okay."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-1/c-5/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Always am."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_jacques_return/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Ha! Don't think I have much of a choice."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well if it ain't the sunshine of my life."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Look at ya. Every time I see that gorgeous face of yours I feel like..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/16
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Like..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/24
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well dang! Words just ain't even sufficient."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not like you to be so tongue-tied, Abel."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to Realize you, Abel."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Guess there's only one way to show ya just what I'm feelin'."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No no, I believe you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Ah. Well alright then."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You come back anytime you need a reminder, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I'll be sure to count all the ways I love ya."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel pulls you in close, planting a kiss on your lips that makes you forget your own name for a few moments."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Now you get on out of here before I'm tempted to whisk you away myself."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I got work to do and I can't concentrate when you're here lookin' at me like that."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well look at you, walkin' around sprinklin' sunshine and leavin' rainbows wherever you go."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_friend_return/0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Always a blessed day when I get to see that kind smile o' yours."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_friend_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, Abel. You're such a steady friend."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_friend_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Abel, I want to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You take care and have a good one, ya hear?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well well. If it ain't the dark cloud over my picnic."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You actually need somethin'? Or you just here to make my day worse?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Actually, I don't care why you're here."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm right sorry, Abel. Look into my eyes. (USE POISE CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Just beat it, why don'tcha."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/c-1/25/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorrier than a cat caught in a thunderstorm."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/c-1/25/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/c-1/25/c-0/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "A cat caught in a thunderstorm... hoo wee, you must really mean it."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/c-1/25/c-0/23
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Alright, alright. You got me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/c-1/25/c-0/34
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I respect a human who can come to me hat in hand and try to make amends."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/c-1/25/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I won't let you down, Abel."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_hate_return/0/c-1/25/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I'll support you as best I can. Just make sure you've got coasters, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/3
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Mac told me somethin' real cute to call ya. Ready for this?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/14
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/22
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You're my little <w>solnyshka</w>."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/30
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Solynshka? Aww... I think you are meaning solnyshko."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/38
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Oh, dang it. I practiced that one so many times."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/49
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No, no. I love it."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/57
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And I love you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/65
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "...I love you too."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You two are too cute for words. I'm just gonna leave you to it."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/74/s/0 abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Abel, Dasha, I want to Realize you both!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Well, thank you friend. You take care now."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bye bye, lovebirds."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Have the greatest day!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/3
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "There you are. Was just talkin' about you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/11
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I was telling Abel how thankful I am for you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/19
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "It wasn't enough for you to make us both happy separately..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/24
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You got all three of us together, too."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/29
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Didn't think you could get any better, but there you are, provin' me wrong."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Come, come, let us kiss you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't have to tell me twice."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha and Abel each kiss you in turn, a one-two punch of sweetness and heat."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Delicious! I do not know who is sweeter, you or Abel."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Guess you'll have to keep smoochin' us both to find out!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds good to me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_return/0/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The smooching lasts for hours... and in the end, the jury was still out."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Realize? Me?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realize_join/0/17/s/0 abel_table/abel_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realize_join/0/18/s/0 abel_table/abel_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realize_join/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Take yer time—no need to rush."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You still got that look in yer eye—you ready to realize me?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realize_return/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "That's okay—I'm a patient table. I can wait as long as ya need."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Starting with the table, huh? I hope I'm Abel to do this!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Yeehaw!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realize_begin/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a table, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realized_solo/0/3
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Whoah... I feel like... I feel like..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realized_solo/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For the first time since you've known him, Abel's ordinarily colorful and expressive language seems to be failing him."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realized_solo/0/19
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Like a... like a fish... no, no, that ain't it! Like a baby deer... a flower bloomin'..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realized_solo/0/27
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Aww, heck. I feel downright <i>human</i>!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realized_solo/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's 'cause you are, Abel."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realized_solo/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's 'cause you are, Abel... but you've always been to me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realized_solo/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I can't thank ya enough for this."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_realized_solo/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "It's time for me to get on out there and see what kinda good I can do... for me now."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel looks at you the way a cowboy looks at the night sky, full of wonder and appreciation."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You stuck by me even when my life wasn't all flowers 'n love songs."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/16
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I got a few regrets yet in my life, but you ain't never gonna be one of 'em."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As he takes your hand in his, there's a heat that simmers between the two of you. It's as gentle as Abel himself, but just as strong."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/26 abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Normally I'd say somethin' like 'You make me feel like a cat with a yarnball made 'a fish and catnip'... but words ain't sufficient."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/34
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Come on, let me show you just how grateful I am."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/42/s/0 abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/51/s/0 abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Take me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/43/s/0 abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/52/s/0 abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is enough for me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/c-0/7 abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Oh, nothing would make me happier."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel takes you in his newly-human manly arms and ravishes you in a way that would make a romance novelist blush."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/c-0/26 abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He's just as gentle as you expected him to be, but he doesn't rest until he's left you breathless and satisfied, entirely focused on your pleasure and satisfaction."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Afterward he's deep in thought, as though there were something lingering on his mind, but when you ask him what's wrong he only gives you a soft smile and tells you absolutely nothing now that you're here."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert_solo/0/c-1/7 abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I'm glad you understand. I'll always be grateful to ya."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_join_solo/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Now human and in possession of actual hands to work with, Abel immediately goes out into the world to try his hand at something he's quietly been interested in: gardening."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_join_solo/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The former table is a natural at it—perhaps it's his ability to focus on the needs of others, and those gentle hands of his."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_join_solo/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As happy and fulfilled as Abel's garden makes him, however, he does seem to spend a lot of time out there contemplating and sighing."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_join_solo/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you try to ask him what's on his mind, he just gives you a sad little smile."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_join_solo/32
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "A man keeps his regrets to hisself."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_join_solo/40
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I may not be a table anymore, but I ain't about to let anyone else carry my burdens."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_join_solo/45
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Now come gimme a hand with these weeds, won't ya?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_question/0/6
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Now hold on one minute!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_question/0/14
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Before anyone goes on getting themselves Realized alone, I think what we have here is a duo Realization opportunity!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_question/0/25
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You cannot be thinking of leaving the house without me!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_question/0/33
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Never, darlin'."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_question/0/41
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "In order to get them both Realized, you'll only need to worry about ONE of their recipes, on account of them being in love and stuff.."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_question/0/61/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I do still have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_question/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah that's too much for me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_question/0/c-1/16
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "No problem—we waited this long for each other."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_question/0/c-1/24
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "We're real patient."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_question/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We will wait as long as you require!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_return/0/3
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have returned!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_return/0/11
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "How are you feelin'? You think you got what it takes now?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_return/0/19
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Are you ready to do heavy lifting?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_return/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I now have what it takes!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_return/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh god no, that's too much for me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_return/0/c-1/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Take your time. Is no need to rush."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_return/0/c-1/24
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "We'll be right here when you're ready."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Starting with a duo Realization? Good thing they're both going steady!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Abel and Dasha, let's do this thing!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realize_begin/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a table and a desk, become...."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Whooooah!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This is... !"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha and Abel look first at themselves, and then at each other, and then they're rushing forward into a joyful hug, laughing and crying and twirling around."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/33
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha lifts Abel, Abel lifts Dasha, and then they're both turning to look at you, arms outstretched."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it my turn for a twirl-hug?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want a hug too, Abel!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want a hug too, Dasha!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want a hug from both of you at the same time!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They don't even bother with a verbal response, both of them rushing forward to lift you up so quickly and enthusiastically you almost scream—you haven't been lifted off your feet this easily since you were a toddler."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "We're never gonna forget this, friend!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You will have our gratitude forever!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/c-3/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel and Dasha lift you into the air between them, each kissing your cheek in turn."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_realized/0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You find yourself surrounded by love and muscle in equal measure."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel lifts you into his arms, hugging you with an unmistakable heat. His voice is a low murmur as he speaks to you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/16
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Come an' let me show ya just how grateful I am."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you look over his shoulder to Dasha, she gives you a sweet smile, all sincerity and warmth."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/35
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It warms my heart to see you happy together."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/43
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I will take my time with Abel later. Do not worry about Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel takes you away in his newly-human manly arms and ravishes you in a way that would make a romance novelist blush."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Afterward he seems thoughtful, but when you ask what's on his mind his thoughtful expression is replaced with a contented smile."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_love_divert/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Just never thought a man could have it all... and now I do."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha lifts you into her arms, hugging you with enthusiasm and a passion that's truly impossible to ignore."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When she speaks to you it's not difficult to imagine what's on her mind."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps we should take some time alone, hm?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I wish to show you the depths of my feelings for you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you look over Dasha's shoulder at Abel, he only smiles warmly and tips his hat at you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/40
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I couldn't be happier fer you two, pal. Don't you worry about me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/48
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Me n' Dasha can spend some time together later."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Whatever you desire..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha whisks you away to your bedroom, where she performs feats of strength and flexibility that make your head spin."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She doesn't stop until the two of you are entirely exhausted, putting her newly human muscles to work in service of your mutual pleasure."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/28
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Afterward she is her usual sweet self, but there's an extra twinkle in her eye when she smiles at you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/36
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have spoiled me, beloved. To have you hold one hand and Abel the other..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/44
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I did not think I could be so happy. I will never forget what you have done for me... for us."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/dasha_love_divert/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am glad you are happy, beloved. This is all I need."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I feel like we can do a little better than a hug for ya... ain't that right, Dasha?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Yes... much more than a hug."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes please."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A hug is enough for me."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The two of them whisk you away, Dasha lifting you into her arms and almost sprinting for your bedroom."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You'd have imagined sleeping with these two would have led to a broken bed, or head to toe bruises at the very least, but Dasha and Abel are as respectful of your person and your furniture as they are passionate about you and each other."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You make love with abandon, but at the end of it all your bedframe is somehow still standing—a true miracle."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Understood—we just wanna make sure you know how we feel about ya."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Even two hearts are not enough to contain the love we have for you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I ain't never gonna forget this, amigo, and neither is she."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You must come to see us—as happy as we will be, we will only be happier when you are with us."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_divert/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Darn right. Our love story just ain't complete without you."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel and Dasha truly blossom when they leave your home, finding the chance to finally focus on themselves rather than holding up everyone else around them."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_join/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel takes up gardening, and while Dasha tries her best to help him initially she finds she's not much for weeding and watering."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She truly finds herself in the kitchen, incorporating Abel's produce into meals hearty and fulfilling enough to sustain their considerable muscle."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_join/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What have you grown for us today, beloved?"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_join/29
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I got some real prize-winning potatoes for you, darlin'!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_join/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Wonderful. Then tonight we will have potato and cheese piroshki!"
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_join/45
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Just when I think I can't love you more..."
msgstr ""

#: abel_table/abel_dasha_love_join/53
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha gets into collecting aprons, each more frilly and ridiculous than the last—Abel, for his part, is all too thrilled to contribute to her collection, bringing her a new one every time he returns from the farmer's market."
msgstr ""
